      "start_seconds": 307.24,
      "end_seconds": 330.45,
      "duration_seconds": 23.21,
      "text": "I want a chest X-ray done that's for COPD flare. What I'm giving you is prednisolone 30 milligrams once a day five days. That should help with COPD flare. Use your inhaler regularly and get seen if you are not better in three days. See me again in one week"
